WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.080 --> 00:00:02.770
A Sabbath in Pisidian Antioch.

2
00:00:02.820 --> 00:00:05.020
After the reading of the
law and the prophets,

3
00:00:05.070 --> 00:00:07.570
a visitor is invited to speak.

4
00:00:07.620 --> 00:00:13.060
Later, in Athens, philosophers sneer:
What does this babbler want to say?

5
00:00:13.110 --> 00:00:15.750
Some think he is preaching foreign gods.

6
00:00:15.800 --> 00:00:18.960
So did Paul change his
message for each audience,

7
00:00:19.010 --> 00:00:20.950
or only his words?

8
00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:24.590
In this mission, you'll build the
synagogue sermon step by step,

9
00:00:24.640 --> 00:00:27.130
from Israel's story to its warning.

10
00:00:27.180 --> 00:00:31.440
Then you'll set the two speeches side
by side and weigh up whether Athens was

11
00:00:31.490 --> 00:00:32.850
a failure.

12
00:00:32.900 --> 00:00:36.610
Your mission: find out what
changed between the two speeches,

13
00:00:36.660 --> 00:00:38.030
and what stayed the same.
